import QIQTH.ExpJet5D5Val
import QIQTH.ExpJet5D5CurveG
import Mathlib

/-!
# JET-5 TOWER — genuine order-5 value multilinearity `expJet5ValG_{add,smul}` (J5-4 support)

The five-slot multilinearity of the genuine fifth-variation value `expJet5ValG` (mirror of
`expJet4ValG_{add,smul}_*` one Fréchet order up), via `expJet5Val_congr` + `expJet5Val_{add,smul}_*`
and the pair/triple/quadruple feeder multilinearity.  This is the datum the `expJetD5`
packaging consumes.

## Honest firewall (binding)
J5-4 support only.  NOT `exp_p ∈ C⁵`, NOT `κ = 1/6`, NOT `a₁ = R/6`.  Axiom-free.
-/

namespace QIQTH.ExpMap

open QIQTH.Curvature QIQTH.Geodesic
open Finset Topology

set_option maxSynthPendingDepth 4
set_option maxHeartbeats 6400000
set_option synthInstance.maxHeartbeats 2000000
set_option maxRecDepth 8000

variable {n : ℕ}


